NNAAMMEE
     aacccceepptt, aacccceepptt44 — accept a connection on a socket

LLIIBBRRAARRYY
     Standard C Library (libc, -lc)

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     ##iinncclluuddee <<ssyyss//ttyyppeess..hh>>
